XML_1_SEARCH_ENVELOPE "$(XML_IN_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_MAXY_XML_1)"
GUI OPTIONAL FLOAT XML_IN_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_MAXY_XML_1 Maximum Y:
# ===========================================================================
GUI LOOKUP XML_IN_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_COORDINATE_SYSTEM_XML_1 <Unused>, 
