XML_1_SEARCH_ENVELOPE "$(XML_IN_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_COORDINATE_SYSTEM_XML_1)"
GUI OPTIONAL COORDSYS XML_IN_SEARCH_ENVELOPE_COORDINATE_SYSTEM_XML_1 Search Envelope Coordinate System:
